Since our focus is on analyzing and improving the inherent ability of the generative LM to provide factually grounded responses based on relevant information provided in the context, we do not compare to any dataset specific and task specific fine-tuning methods. For a fair comparison, we do not tune the hyper-parameters for SELFELICIT. They are fixed as $\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{ER}}$ being the last $50\%$ layers and $\alpha = 0.5$ .

